My main point was that if we want the model code to do the right thing we either a) need to figure out from the model specification which representation to use when parameterizing the model (I think this is going to be hard and error prone for everything but really simple cases) or have the user tell us, either by hinting when defining a cov_matrix parameter, or by requiring to the user to build the covariance matrix themselves in the model (what I had proposed).

