>
> data {
> matrix(rows,cols) X;
> }

If you can make the doc, I fully documented
the dump format that stan uses for reads.
It basically a subset of the R produces with dump.
The reason I say subset, as I mention in the doc,
is that if you dump out a 2x3 matrix in R,
it writes the dimensions as "2:3", whereas if you
dump out a 2x4 matrix, it writes it as "c(2,4)".
I didn't write Stan's dump reader generally enough
to deal with "2:3".  At least not yet.

