Right now the test-bugs target verifies:
1) that the compiler is indeed compilable (bin/stanc)
2) that each BUGS model is able to be translated through the stanc compiler
3) that each BUGS model is compilable by the compiler
4) that each BUGS model runs to completion (that is, to 2000 samples)

Once the mcmc_output is created, we can write unit tests that will check the output of the stan results.

This target was created to run on Jenkins. It runs once a day just to make sure we can do the things above.

