Subject: unit tests vs. regression tests
Message-ID: <T4rnuGSQ2ds.miZe5P3Rl_0J@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <T4rnuGSQ2ds.c6c7eLELhtYJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
References: <T4rnuGSQ2ds.c6c7eLELhtYJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
