Not in Stan.  You could always add one.
It would get a different sized dot product
in the value of the result vector.

I don't know how Eigen deals with
(triangular-matrix * vector) multiplication.
To state the obvious, I'd look for operator*
with a triangular matrix argument.

- Bob

